var GV = "<i>Data for Q91–93: in a spring-controlled governor, the controlling force curve is a straight line. The balls are 450 mm apart when the controlling force is 1450 N and 250 mm apart when it is 750 N. The mass of each ball is 8 kg.</i><br>";
